  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/V93aHk3.png\" alt=\"Banner\" width=\"2528\" height=\"1440\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">便攜生物讓玩家可以捕捉生物並隨身攜帶。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/hVPywRO.png\" alt=\"Separator \" width=\"2528\" height=\"96\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>捕捉容器：</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JSMZOEU.png\" alt=\"basic capture cell\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;基礎捕捉容器</h4>\n<p>- 捕捉並放生一隻生物後會損毀。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/wjdTLWo.png\" alt=\"master capture cell\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;進階捕捉容器</h4>\n<p>- 可無限次重複使用。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/hVPywRO.png\" alt=\"Separator \" width=\"2528\" height=\"96\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>基礎捕捉容器：</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/E0hakxT.gif\" alt=\"gif basic\" width=\"843\" height=\"474\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>進階捕捉容器：</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UItI5Zo.gif\" alt=\"gif master\" width=\"843\" height=\"474\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/hVPywRO.png\" alt=\"Separator \" width=\"2528\" height=\"96\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>常見問題</strong></h3>\n<h4><strong>我可以在我的整合包中使用您的模組嗎？</strong></h4>\n<h4>- 可以，歡迎在您的整合包中使用便攜生物！</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/hVPywRO.png\" alt=\"Separator \" width=\"2528\" height=\"96\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
